usage: verify.py [-h] [--check | --selftest | --anchors] [--log LOG]

Independently verify public schema v10 against pinned t62-t69 evidence.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --check     verify public v10 pair (default)
  --selftest  run verification and tamper probes
  --anchors   run t01 anchor regression
  --log LOG   write successful check summary to spot_*.log under this
              directory
